<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Block vs Inline Practice</title>
  <style>
    
    .block-demo {
      background-color: #e0f7fa;
      border: 1px solid #00838f;
      padding: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .highlight {
      background-color: #fff59d;
      font-weight: bold;
      padding: 2px 4px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <h1>Main Page Title </h1>
  <h2>Section Title </h2>

  <div class="block-demo">
    <h3>paragraph 3</h3>
    
    <p>
      This is a paragraph , which is a block-level element. Inside this 
      paragraph, we have an <span class="highlight">inline span tag</span> to 
      highlight text, 
      <a href="https://youtube.com">inline anchor link</a> 
      that flows seamlessly within the text.
    </p>

    <p>
    Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Ipsam, nihil ullam qui dolor repellendus maiores illum eligendi corrupti ad minima! Odio facilis maxime quo adipisci reiciendis vitae ad natus explicabo.
    </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
